    "chunk_text": "Divisional Secretariat of Athuraliya, 12th June 2019. 07 - 35\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A\n\n(Published by Authority) PART III \u2014 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nG 30306 - 23 (2019/06)\n\nCORRECTION PAPER Notice under Section 07 of the Land Acquisition Act (Chapter 460) My Ref. No. : MT/LA/4/29. Land Ministry's Ref. No.: LD/2001/VEP/234. THE General Public is hereby informed that the extent of the allotment published under Section 07 of the Land Acquisition Act in the Gazette Extraordinary No. 1358/4\n\ndated 13/09/2004 of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka as Lot No. 01 shall be amended as Lot No. 02. SHYAMA P. KARIYAWASAM, Divisional Secretary, Mathugama.\n\nDivisional Secretariat, Mathugama. 07 - 36\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
