    "chunk_text": "IV ^wd& jeks fldgi \u2013 YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2018'04'09Part IV (B) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 09.04.20181A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2128$14 - 2019 cqks ui 18 jeks w\u00d5yrejdod - 2019'06'18No. 2128/14 - TUESDAY JUNE 18, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nFILLING OF A VACANCY IN THE OFFICE OF MEMBER OF THE MAHARA PRADESHIYASABHA UNDER SECTION 66A(1) OF THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONS ORDINANCE(CHAPTER 262)\n\nWHEREAS the office of member of Mahara Pradeshiya Sabha has fallen vacant by reason of not attending consecutivemeetings without permission ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the Sri Lanka Freedom Party, the recognized political party to which WanniArachchige Susanthasiri the member belonged, was required by me under Section 66 A (1) of the aforesaid ordinance, todecide upon return member if Sri Lanka Freedom Party, who belongs to such party and is not disqualified under Section9 of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance and who shall be declared selected as a member within a period of thirty(30) days ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the secretary of the aforesaid recognized political party has communicated his decision tonominate Wanni Arachchige Susanthasiri to fill such vacancy ;\n\nNOW THEREFORE, I, Karunasingha Jayarathnage Sampath Madhawa, Returning Officer of the Mahara PradeshiyaSabha, acting in terms of Section 66A(1) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) do hereby declarethat Wanni Arachchige Susanthasiri was selected as the member of the Mahara Pradeshiya Sabha.\n\nK. J. S. MADHAWA,Returning Officer,Mahara Pradeshiya Sabha.District Election Office,Gampaha,18th June, 2019.\n\n07 - 38\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART IV (B) \u2014 LOCAL GOVERNMENT\n\nNotices under the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance"
