    "chunk_text": "SURANGA AMBAGAHATHENNE,Returning Officer,Embilipitiya Pradeshiya Sabha.District Election Office,Ratnapura,20th June, 2019.\n\n07 - 194/1\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART IV (B) \u2014 LOCAL GOVERNMENT\n\nNotices under the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance\n\n2AIV ^wd& jeks fldgi \u2013 YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'06'24Part IV (B) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 24.06.2019\n\nFILLING OF A VACANCY IN THE OFFICE OF VICE CHAIRMAN OF THE EMBILIPITIYAPRADESHIYA SABHA UNDER SECTION 66B(2) OF THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONSORDINANCE (CHAPTER 262) AS AMENDED BY LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTION (AMENDED)ACT, NO. 16 OF 2017\n\nWHEREAS the office of Vice Chairman in Embilipitiya Pradeshiya Sabha has fallen vacant by reason of Vice Chairmanhas been appointed as Chairman ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the Sri Lanka Podujana Peramuna, the recognized political party to whichWeerasinghage Surantha Jayalath the former vice chairman belonged, was required by me under Section 66B(2) of theaforesaid ordinance, to decide upon the member of that Embilipitiya Pradeshiya Sabha who belongs to such party whoshall be declared elected as vice chairman within a period of thirty (30) days ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the aforesaid recognized political party has communicated his decision tonominate Mathara Arachchige Jayaweera to fill such vacancy ;\n\nNOW THEREFORE, I, Suranga Ambagahathenne, Returning Officer of Embilipitiya Pradeshiya Sabha, acting interms of Section 66B(2) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) as amended by Local AuthoritiesElection (amended) Act, No. 16 of 2017 do hereby declare Mathara Arachchige Jayaweera elected as vice chairman ofthe Embilipitiya Pradeshiya Sabha.\n\nSURANGA AMBAGAHATHENNE,Returning Officer,Embilipitiya Pradeshiya Sabha.District Election Office,Ratnapura,20th June, 2019.\n\n07 - 194/2"
