    "chunk_text": "1AIII fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'06'25PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 25.06.2019\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nORDER UNDER SECTION 39A(1)\n\nTHE allotments specified in the Order No. 109 of 2013 made underthe Proviso (a) to Section 38 of the Land Acquisition Act(Chapter 460) and published in the Gazette Extra OrdinaryNo. 1807/22 dated 26.04.2013 is vested absolutely in the State andthe possession of which has been taken for or on behalf of the Stateunder Para (a) of Section 40 of the aforesaid Act. But by the virtue ofpowers vested in me by sub-section (1) of Section 39(a) (inserted byAct, No. 8 of 1979) of the Land Acquisition Act. I, GayanthaKarunatilleke, Minister of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms,do hereby divest only the alltoment described in the Schedule 1below.\n\nGayantha Karunatilleke,Minister of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms.\n\nMy Ref. No.: 4-3/10/2012/LRB/20.Acquiring Officer No.: WGSWD & EIP/ACQ/KB/05.Ministry of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms,\u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d,Rajamalwatta Avenue,Battaramulla.18th June, 2019.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nTwo Allotments of land depicted in below names and extents inthe amended Preliminary Plan No. Co. 9569 dated 05.05.2019prepared by the Surveyor-General, situated in the Villagecalled Papiliyana in the Grama Niladhari Division No. 535 B ofDiwulapitiya West in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division ofKesbewa in Colombo District of Western Province and bounded asfollows:\n\n01. Lot No. 28 \u2013 Land (part of) bearing Assmt. No. 56/1 atDiwulapitiya Road \u2013 Extent: About 0.0651 HectareNorth: Lot No. 27 and Canal; East: Canal and Lot No. 30; South:Lot Nos. 30, 29 and Land bearing Assmt. No. 56/1 at DiwulapitiyaRoad; West: Lot No. 29, Land bearing Assmt. No. 56/1 atDiwulapitiya Road and Lot No. 27."
  },
