    "chunk_text": "wxl 2129$61 - 2019 cqks ui 26 jeks n\u00de\u00de - 2019'06'26\n\nNo. 2129/61 \u2013 WEDNESDAY, JUNE 26, 2019\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nYS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www. documents.gov.lk1A\n\n1A- G 30385 - 17 (2019/06)\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nLand Ministry Ref. No.: 4-3/6/2017/HW/236. My Ref. No. : 3/3/2/85/iii-39.\n\nI hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of theLand Acquisition Act, that the Government intends to acquirethe following lands which are required for a public purpose.\n\nDescription of the land to be acquired:\n\nLot Nos. 277 - 380 \u2013 12 allotments of land in Total Extent ofabout 0.0079 Hectare, in Cadastral Map No. 520028, BlockNo.24, Sheet No.4 and dated 27.03.2019 prepared by the Senior- Superintendent of Surveyor of Colombo District on behalf ofthe Surveyor General, situated in the village of Watareka inthe Grama Niladhari Division of No.448, Watareka South inthe Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Homagama in ColomboDistrict in the Western Province.\n\n01. Lot No. 277Name of land: Kandebodawatta; Description: Garden;Claimant: State; Original claimant: Kuruppu Arachchige LalithChandrasiri Upananda Kuruppu (address Cannot be found)(tofinalize the land acquisition); Extent: 0.0004 Hectare.\n\n02. Lot No. 302Name of land: Kandebodawatta; Description: Garden;Claimant: State; Original claimant: Kudaasingappulige KamalaDayawathie, No.104, Watareka, Padukka (to finalize the landacquisition); Extent: 0.0002 Hectare.\n\n03. Lot No. 319Name of land: Kandebodawatta; Description: Garden;Claimant: State; Original claimant: Mambulage ChinthakaChaminda, No.99A, Watareka, Padukka (to finalize the landacquisition); Extent: 0.0018 Hectare."
