    "chunk_text": "IV ^wd& jeks fldgi \u2013 YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'06'03Part IV (B) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 03.06.20191A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2129$64 - 2019 cqks ui 26 jeks nodod - 2019'06'26No. 2129/64 - WEDNESDAY JUNE 26, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nFILLING OF A VACANCY IN THE OFFICE OF MEMBER OF THE ARANAYAKA PRADESHIYASABHA UNDER SECTION 66A(1)(a) OF THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONS ORDINANCE(CHAPTER 262)\n\nWHEREAS the office of member of Aranayaka pradeshiya Sabha has fallen vacant by reason of being ceased to be amember of the party ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the Sri Lanka Podujana Peramuna, the recognized political party to whichAmarasingha Arachchilage Ishara Madushani Amarasingha the member belonged, was required by me under Section 66 A(1)(a) of the aforesaid ordinance, to decide upon the member of that 7 - Debathgama of Aranayaka Pradeshiya Sabha whobelongs to such party and is not disqualified under Section 9 of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance and who shallbe declared elected as a member within a period of thirty (30) days ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the aforesaid recognized political party has communicated his decision tonominate Ethugal Pedige Wimalawathi to fill such vacancy ;\n\nNOW THEREFORE, I, Sajith Wasantha Welgama, Returning Officer of the Aranayaka pradeshiya Sabha, acting interms of Section 66A(1)(a) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) do hereby declare that EthugalPedige Wimalawathi was elected as the member of the 7 - Debathgama of Aranayaka pradeshiya Sabha.\n\nSAJITH WASANTHA WELGAMA,Returning Officer,Aranayaka pradeshiya Sabha.District Election Office,Kegalle,25th June, 2019.\n\n07 - 300\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART IV (B) \u2014 LOCAL GOVERNMENT\n\nNotices under the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance"
