    "md5": "df1085191aceb37ea947a693aac97a86",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1191,
    "chunk_text": "\u201c(b) any export oriented manufacturing company, which has entered into an agreement with the Board of Investment ofSri Lanka under Section 17 of the Board of Investment of Sri Lanka Law, No.04 of 1978 (Hereafter called \u201cBOIapproved manufacturing company\u201d), and export 100% of its products, manufactured by using the items in theSchedule 1 of Excise Notification No. 07/2018 published in the Gazette Extraordinary No. 2059/32 dated February 21,2018 as its raw materials and such export is certified by the Director General of the Board of Investment of Sri Lanka,Excise duty on importation of such raw materials shall not be levied with effect from October 04, 2018.\n\nProvided that, if any such BOI approved manufacturing company sells a part of its product in the local market asapproved by the BOI, such company shall pay duty as prescribed in Paragraph (a) of aforesaid Excise NotificationNo. 07/2018, proportionately on such part of the raw materials as attributable to the products sold in the localmarket.\u201d\n\nR. H. S. SAMARATUNGA,Secretary,Ministry of Finance.\n\nMinistry of Finance,Colombo 01,June 28, 2019.\n\n07 - 494\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
